7
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:21,410
So why are you so dressed up?
你穿這麼漂亮做什麼呢？

8
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:23,780
Mike's picking me up for a date.
麥克要來接我去約會

9
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:26,920
How's that going? Is it getting serious?
交往得如何呢？ 是不是越來越認真了？

10
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:30,550
I don't know. I don't know. I mean, I like him.
我不知道，我不知道 我是蠻喜歡他的

11
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:34,060
But am I ready to take my Grade A loins off the meat market?
但是我還沒有準備好要退出江湖

12
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:36,360
