Every time I thought about what you said, I cried.
每次我想到你說的話，我就哭了

94
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:44,890
I'm pretty sure he spent most of the night just staring at me in horror.
我非常肯定他整晚都驚恐的盯著我看

95
00:06:45,070 --> 00:06:49,130
But I couldn't know for sure because my eyes were swollen shut.
但是我無法真的確定 因為我的眼睛已經腫到張不開了

96
00:06:50,370 --> 00:06:52,770
You know I wasn't trying to make you cry.
你知道我不是故意要惹你哭的

97
