132
00:08:53,130 --> 00:08:54,990
No, we didn't do it here..
不對，沒有在這裡…

133
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:59,030
which is weird, because it seems like a perfectly good place.
這倒是很奇怪，看起來超適合的

134
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,790
